== Walkthrough ==

Ergrez will make you a Direwolf Fur Cloak if you bring him a [[Medium Quality Dire Wolf Fur]] and 2 [[Skinning Rock]]s.

''Ergrez does not respond to hails at indifferent faction.''

Upon handing in the items, you receive [[Direwolf Fur Cloak]] and the message of:
"Ergrez Shortpaw works with the fur for awhile by skinning it and sewing it."

